copy-position raw reads after a partial write: ell is read-before-write: true
copy-position raw reads: ell is an input of the routine: true
copy-position raw reads: the uncovered cells read the incoming values: true
uninitialized accumulation: x is read-before-write: true
uninitialized accumulation: x is an input of the routine: true
uninitialized accumulation: updated in place over the incoming values: true
zero-initialized accumulation: covered by the real write, not read-before-write: true
zero-initialized accumulation: y is not an input: true
zero-initialized accumulation: the sentinel seed is overwritten: true
undecided partial-write producer: keeps its virtualization eligibility: true
